---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-kent-blue">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last Updated: October 2024</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-justify">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">1. Cancellation Policy</h2>
        <p>You can cancel your service booking at any time before the technician arrives at your doorstep. To cancel, please call us at <strong>08062180546</strong>. There is no cancellation fee.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">2. Visit Charge (₹299)</h2>
        <p>The basic visit charge of ₹299 covers the diagnosis and inspection of your RO purifier. This amount is <strong>non-refundable</strong> once the technician has visited your home and provided a diagnosis, even if you choose not to proceed with the repair.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">3. Refund on Spare Parts</h2>
        <p>If a replaced spare part is found to be defective within the 90-day warranty period, we will replace it free of cost. We do not offer cash refunds for installed spare parts.</p>
        <p class="mt-2">If a customer pays in advance for a special ordered part (not standard stock) and cancels the order before installation, a refund will be initiated after deducting a 10% restocking/cancellation fee.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">4. Service Quality Guarantee</h2>
        <p>If you are not satisfied with the quality of our repair, please contact us immediately. We will send a senior technician to re-inspect the issue at no extra cost. If the issue cannot be resolved, a partial or full refund of the labor charge may be considered at management's discretion.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>